# S4 (tomorrow morning, plan.md re-serve R1): after the night's last optimisation job, reset all four boards so the
# serving mesh opens on freshly trained links, then re-measure the fabric (tt-measure-links.yml apply=true) and
# /deploy. Only when the image is unchanged since S2b passed; a new base or thin layer needs S1-S2b again.
# status prints the containers (must be none), the agent journal and the four-card preconditions.
# C1 as in S1. Duration: status 1-2 min, reset 3-12 min.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=status reset
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-g1-C1
C2_PROFILE=general-prefix-tp4
